course: dictionary
lesson: 14566
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them show you which one is right. Pickup is one of these words. Look at the clues before you choose a meaning.
explain: «Dad drove the dusty pickup along the farm road, with hay in the back.» Farm, dusty and hay are clues. A pickup here is a vehicle with a cabin at the front and an open back for carrying things.
explain: «Mum was late for school pickup today.» School and late are the clues. Pickup here means the time when parents collect children from school.
explain: «Please pick up the phone.» Pick up is two words, and it is a verb. It means lift, so you lift the phone. «She picked up Spanish in one summer» means she learned it easily.
fact: Pickup is a noun: a pickup, pickups.
fact: Pick up is a two-word verb: pick up, picks up, picked up, picking up.
fact: A pickup truck has a cabin in front and an open back for carrying things.
fact: «School pickup» means the act of collecting someone, here children from school.
fact: «Pick up a language» means to learn it easily, without much effort.
exercise: «The farmer loaded hay into the back of the pickup.» What is a pickup here? | A tiny bird | *A vehicle with an open back for carrying things | A kind of cake | A school bell
exercise: «Sales had a pickup in the spring.» What does pickup mean here? | *A rise or improvement | A fall in price | A broken machine | A small animal
exercise: «She had to pick up her toys before bed.» What does pick up mean? | Break into pieces | *Lift and collect | Hide under the bed | Forget about
test: «Joe waited at the gate for the school pickup.» What does school pickup mean? | *Parents collecting children from school | Lunch in the school hall | A school trip to the zoo
test: «The guitar pickup made the strings sound loud.» What is the pickup? | A small wooden box for picks | A guitar strap | *The part that turns string sounds into electric signals | A tuning peg
exam: «Tom will pick up the pizza on the way home.» What does pick up mean here? | Throw away | *Collect | Burn | Sleep
